<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
	<NeedDef>
		<defName>sayers_stability</defName>
		<needClass>SayersRemake.Need_Stability_Sayers</needClass>
		<label>稳定度</label>
		<description>稳定度代表着这只赛尔斯精神负荷压制程序运行的稳定程度，它不会自然降低，但会在每次精神崩溃发生时阻止精神崩溃并随之降低。若余量不足，则可能导致比普通精神崩溃更为严重的后果。它会随着情绪正常化而得到恢复。\n更高的稳定度意味着更稳定的工作效率但更低的心灵敏感度，低稳定度反之。</description>
		<minIntelligence>Humanlike</minIntelligence>
		<baseLevel>1.0</baseLevel>
		<seekerRisePerHour>0</seekerRisePerHour>
		<seekerFallPerHour>0</seekerFallPerHour>
		<listPriority>1000</listPriority>
		<major>true</major>
		<freezeWhileSleeping>true</freezeWhileSleeping>
		<showForCaravanMembers>true</showForCaravanMembers>
		<developmentalStageFilter>Baby, Child, Adult</developmentalStageFilter>
	</NeedDef>
	<NeedDef>
		<defName>sayers_PhysiologicalCycle</defName>
		<needClass>SayersRemake.Need_PhysiologicalCycle_Sayers</needClass>
		<label>生理循环</label>
		<description>生理循环代表着这只塞尔斯的器官及植物的健康情况，当生理循环过低时，塞尔斯将更容易患上衰竭性疾病，甚至是枯萎病。</description>
		<minIntelligence>Humanlike</minIntelligence>
		<baseLevel>1.0</baseLevel>
		<seekerRisePerHour>0</seekerRisePerHour>
		<seekerFallPerHour>0</seekerFallPerHour>
		<listPriority>1000</listPriority>
		<major>true</major>
		<freezeWhileSleeping>true</freezeWhileSleeping>
		<showForCaravanMembers>true</showForCaravanMembers>
		<developmentalStageFilter>Baby, Child, Adult</developmentalStageFilter>
	</NeedDef>
</Defs>